{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46112","headline":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 一 · 贯休","name":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岳渎殊祥日月精，入尧金镜佐休明。\n衣严黻黼皇恩重，劒折芙蓉紫气横。\n玉甃金汤山岳峻，花藏台榭管弦清。\n已闻图上凌烟阁，宠渥穹窿玉不名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}